# VentureBridge Frontend Environment Configuration Example
# Set this in your Vercel Project Settings > Environment Variables for Production and Preview branches.

# Backend API Base URL
# In local development: Leave empty or omit to use Vite's built-in /api proxy (defaults to http://127.0.0.1:8000).
# Optional local port override: set BACKEND_PORT or VITE_BACKEND_PORT (e.g. 8000 or 8001).
# BACKEND_PORT=8000
# In production on Vercel: Set to your live Render backend URL, for example:
VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://venturebridge-api.onrender.com
